{%- comment -%}
  Normalised "finish family" key for a product title: the part of the title that
  is identical across every finish of the same model, so two products can be
  compared to see whether they are the same machine in a different finish.

  Drops the finish word itself, and also the French Fitness series code that
  carries the finish (FFB = Black, FFS = Silver). Those products are named
  "French Fitness FFB Black <Type>" / "French Fitness FFS Silver <Type>", so
  removing only the colour word would leave FFB vs FFS in the key and the two
  finishes of the same machine would never match.

  Accepts:
    title - {String} the product title (required)
    color - {String} the product's custom.product_color value (required)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign key = title

  if color != blank
    assign finish_codes = 'FFB Black,FFS Silver' | split: ','
    for finish_code in finish_codes
      assign key = key | replace: finish_code, ''
    endfor
    assign key = key | replace: color, ''
  endif

  echo key | downcase | split: ' ' | join: ' '
-%}
